     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I am new to Rhadoop and want to run a simple function using a large file the file has a structure as follows<div><br></div><div><div>YMMKey<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Trim<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>InternetPrice<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Mileage<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Certified<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>SingleOwner</div><div>2015ChevroletSuburban<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>LT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0</div><div>2014ChevroletEquinox<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>LT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>23620<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0</div><div>2014ChevroletSilverado 1500<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>LTZ<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>41695<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0</div><div>2014ChevroletMalibu<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>LT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0</div><div>2014ChevroletVolt<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>36605<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0</div><div>2015ChevroletTahoe<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>LT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>56480<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0</div><div>2015ChevroletSilverado 3500HD<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>LTZ<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>59145<span style=\"white-spa